> what is two and a half?
  ucas: (2*2 + 1)/2
2.5
> what is one and three quarters?
  ucas: (1*4 + 3)/4
1.75
> what is 2 and 1/2?
  note: "and"/"or" between numbers: read as bitwise (& and |), not logical (&& and ||) (say "bitwise and" or "logical and")
  ucas: 2 & 1/2
<english>:1:8: error: '&' needs integer operands (declare the parameter as int or uN)
    2 & 1/2
           ^
> what is the ratio of 4 to 2?
  sorry: "/" needs two or more things, joined by "and"
> what is the ratio of 10 and 5?
  ucas: 10/5
2
